sti nego kad obilno rode pšenica i vino."]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["Čim legnem, odmah u miru i usnem, jer mi samo ti, o Jahve, daješ miran počinak."]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/hrv_iva/PSA/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/hrv_iva/PSA/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/hrv_iva/PSA/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}